WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.820
You want me to give you that reason?

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.230
I'm the one who killed your father.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.650
Ogata!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.870
The key is inside you. The key...

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.370
Is it true that you killed Aca?

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.320
Kiroranke Nispa!

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.170
Kiroranke Nispa!

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.430
<i>Come back nice and healthy...</i>

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.350
<i>So I can murder you!</i>

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.190
Asirpa-san.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.730
I'm renewing our contract as partners.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:53.990
Yeah.

